1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:03,030
(Sheldon:)I'll play along. Ow.

2
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:09,600
(Sheldon:)I had an unusual experience
with Amy last night.

3
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:12,870
(Leonard:)Really? How could you tell?

4
00:00:13,770 --> 00:00:17,370
(Sheldon:)She was attempting
to engage me in gossip.

5
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:19,110
Mm. You don't say.
Yes.

6
00:00:19,110 --> 00:00:21,040
(Sheldon:)I think prolonged exposure
to Penny

7
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:23,950
(Sheldon:)has turned her into a bit
of a Gabby Gertie.

8
00:00:23,950 --> 00:00:25,680
(Leonard:)So, what's the gossip?

9
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:27,780
(Sheldon:)Oh, please, I was just
pointing it out.

10
00:00:27,790 --> 00:00:30,300
(Sheldon:)I have no desire to engage
in the activity.

11
00:00:30,310 --> 00:00:31,720
(Leonard:)Fine, don't tell me.

12
00:00:32,590 --> 00:00:35,980
(Sheldon:)All right, get this.

13
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:39,660
(Amy:)Bernadette is thinking
about breaking up with Howard.

14
00:00:39,670 --> 00:00:41,000
(Sheldon:)Oh...

15
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,130
(Leonard:)That's too bad.
I wonder what happened.

16
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:45,300
(Sheldon:)Mm, it's hard to say.
I can only speculate

17
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:46,740
(Sheldon:)based on the data I collected

18
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:48,610
(Sheldon:)watching my parents' marriage
implode.

19
00:00:48,610 --> 00:00:52,030
(Sheldon:)In that case,
the woman dives into religion,

20
00:00:52,030 --> 00:00:54,780
(Sheldon:)while the man dives
into a bottle-blonde bartender

21
00:00:54,780 --> 00:00:58,370
(Sheldon:)who tries to buy my love
with action figures.

22
00:00:58,370 --> 00:01:11,030
(Sheldon:)Oop! Out of arrows.

